efaultagent 'requester' prop\n* #3895: The reckoning: Update all the vscode.proposed.*.d.ts files\n* #3731: Bump markdown-it from 14.1.0 to 14.1.1\n* #3799: Bump ajv from 8.17.1 to 8.18.0\n* #3848: Bump minimatch from 10.1.1 to 10.2.1\n* #3873: Bump hono from 4.11.8 to 4.12.0\n* #3864: search subagent -> fine-tuned model flighting\n* #3892: Remove unused doc info tool\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=410437&view=logs).</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/releases/289244883/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}}